	(text "POD SUPPLY: two 5 V sources, diode-OR'd: the laptop's USB (D1) and the power box through the cable\n(D2). Either one runs the pod, so it can be programmed and tested on USB alone. U3 makes 3.3 V\nfor the MCU and sensors. D3: 3.3 V present."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
